msgstr "治疗范围"

#: simulation/data/technologies/heal_range.json
#: simulation/data/technologies/heal_range_2.json
msgid "Increases the healing and vision range of all healers."
msgstr "‌提升所有医师单位的治疗能力与视野范围。"

#: simulation/data/technologies/heal_range.json
#: simulation/data/technologies/heal_range_2.json
